    <fullName>Lead_Status__c</fullName>
    <description>Lead processing state, set by the Zoom integration. Not synced (API value Pending setup): waiting for someone to run "Sync Leads to Salesforce" on the session. Lead created / Lead updated: linked to a Lead. No contact details: no email and no phone, so no Lead. Error: the Lead or its Task could not be saved (see API Log, Log Name ZoomLeadService); the next sync of the session retries it.</description>
